<!--
    The tile itself: cover art and its badges, as on Home's tiles: the library source at bottom left (the title replaces it
    on focus, from ListGameItemStyle), and at top left a play mark while the game runs or a download mark while it isn't installed.
    While Playnite installs the game the foot reads Installing... in their place, as the console's tile does. Playnite has
    only the one flag for it, so a game waiting its turn reads Installing... too: loose XAML can't tell the console's Queued.
-->
<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!-- Library source icons, as Home's: path data from Simple Icons (CC0, simpleicons.org; Xbox from v9.21.0), on a 24x24 box. -->
